/**@addtogroup api-core
 * @details
 *
 * The base library provides fundamental features for the VidRe framework.
 * This includes, for example, configuration languages (such as JSON),
 * module loading, etc. 
 * 
 * Note, that even so the GUI uses Qt which provides numerous equivalent 
 * abstractions, the recording deamon or service, respectively, is ultimately 
 * expected to run on a headless machine - and, therefore, should/will not depend
 * on Qt.
 * 
 * @{
 * @defgroup api-core-os            OS utilities
 * @defgroup api-core-cpp           C++ compatibility
 * @defgroup api-core-util          Utilities
 * @defgroup api-core-exception     Errors and exceptions
 * @defgroup api-core-log           Logging
 * @defgroup api-core-memory        Memory
 * @defgroup api-core-script        Scripting
 * @defgroup api-core-settings      Settings
 * @defgroup api-core-io            In-/output
 * @defgroup api-core-storage       Storage
 * @defgroup api-core-plugin        Plugins
 * @defgroup api-core-program       Program invocation and tools
 * @defgroup api-core-details       Implementation details
 * @}
 * */

